    <innerclass refid="class_gaze_1_1_gaze_model" prot="public">Gaze::GazeModel</innerclass>
    <innernamespace refid="namespace_gaze">Gaze</innernamespace>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Gaze Estimation Model interface (Layer 3). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Defines the abstract interface for the gaze estimation inference stage. Receives normalized eye crops and head pose parameters, executes the underlying DNN (e.g. OpenVINO), and outputs a raw 3D gaze direction vector in Space::OpenVINOADASGaze (+X right ear, +Y up, +Z forward towards camera). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
